{"id":"n64237-1-7","stage":4,"title":"손맛 · 手感","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n64237-1-7-1","ko":"너는 항상 그 볼펜만 쓰는구나. 그게 그렇게 좋아?","zh":"你总是只用那支圆珠笔啊。它有那么好吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너는","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너는","audio":"/audio/54abca9caefe5ae47b8e.mp3"}},{"text":"항상","meaning":"总，总是，老，老是，经常","explanation":"항상：总，总是，老，老是，经常。","readings":[{"term":"항상","audio":"/audio/f1d42a32366087dde8c3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"83162","senseId":"1","lemma":"항상","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"항상","audio":"/audio/f1d42a32366087dde8c3.mp3"}},{"text":"그","meaning":"那个","explanation":"그：那个。","readings":[{"term":"그","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"43883","senseId":"1","lemma":"그","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3"}},{"text":"볼펜만","meaning":"圆珠笔","explanation":"볼펜：圆珠笔；만：表示“只、仅”。","readings":[{"term":"볼펜","audio":"/audio/4ba73c1f13e77796fb2e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59469","senseId":"1","lemma":"볼펜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"볼펜만","audio":"/audio/472cc825edbfc7a8b5c6.mp3"}},{"text":"쓰는구나.","meaning":"用，使用","explanation":"쓰다：用，使用；는구나：对新发现或新理解的情况表示感叹，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"쓰다","audio":"/audio/e5721a077be2e027ff8c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71285","senseId":"1","lemma":"쓰다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"쓰는구나","audio":"/audio/fe89de363098408d682c.mp3"}},{"text":"그게","meaning":"那个","explanation":"그것：那个；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"그것","audio":"/audio/49ef044188dcd25ecf37.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31953","senseId":"2","lemma":"그것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그게","audio":"/audio/76f4738285e0cdc443f8.mp3"}},{"text":"그렇게","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그렇게","audio":"/audio/b470a873a66143d27846.mp3"}},{"text":"좋아?","meaning":"好，美，优良，优美","explanation":"좋다：好，美，优良，优美；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"1","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좋아","audio":"/audio/03b87f7121c91d1c28e1.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"f1d42a32366087dd","term":"항상","zh":"总，总是，老，老是，经常","audio":"/audio/f1d42a32366087dde8c3.mp3","entryId":"83162","definition":"无论什么时候都没变地。","pronunciation":["항상"]},{"id":"38c61820e786f234","term":"그","zh":"那个","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3","entryId":"43883","definition":"指代与听话人较近或听话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["그"]},{"id":"4ba73c1f13e77796","term":"볼펜","zh":"圆珠笔","audio":"/audio/4ba73c1f13e77796fb2e.mp3","entryId":"59469","definition":"笔尖的小钢珠随着笔的移动一起滚动、同时带出墨水来写字的一种书写工具。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"e5721a077be2e027","term":"쓰다","zh":"用，使用","audio":"/audio/e5721a077be2e027ff8c.mp3","entryId":"71285","definition":"做某事时利用材料、工具等。","pronunciation":["쓰다"]},{"id":"49ef044188dcd25e","term":"그것","zh":"那个","audio":"/audio/49ef044188dcd25ecf37.mp3","entryId":"31953","definition":"指代前面已提到过的对象。","pronunciation":["그걷"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"好，美，优良，优美","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"性质或内容等很优秀，让人满意。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]}],"audio":"/audio/41d73c586b2a840c5085.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n64237-1-7-2","ko":"이 볼펜은 다른 필기구들과는 손맛이 다르다니까.","zh":"这支圆珠笔的书写手感和其他笔可不一样哦。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这，这个","explanation":"이：这，这个。","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71687","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}},{"text":"볼펜은","meaning":"圆珠笔","explanation":"볼펜：圆珠笔；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"볼펜","audio":"/audio/4ba73c1f13e77796fb2e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59469","senseId":"1","lemma":"볼펜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"볼펜은","audio":"/audio/542747c19ff7ca0c9317.mp3"}},{"text":"다른","meaning":"其他，别的","explanation":"다른：其他，别的。","readings":[{"term":"다른","audio":"/audio/f1f4ce417552e1974311.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64530","senseId":"1","lemma":"다른","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다른","audio":"/audio/f1f4ce417552e1974311.mp3"}},{"text":"필기구들과는","meaning":"书写工具","explanation":"필기구：书写工具；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象；과：连接共同参与或比较的对象，常表示“和、与”；结合句中动作理解；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"필기구","audio":"/audio/7d0f199c16a288265746.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84316","senseId":"1","lemma":"필기구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"필기구들과는","audio":"/audio/6fef2c40afcf42d78459.mp3"}},{"text":"손맛이","meaning":"手感","explanation":"손맛：手感；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"손맛","audio":"/audio/56905f3c55459a5a28ad.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64237","senseId":"1","lemma":"손맛","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"손맛이","audio":"/audio/1c8c0787d7a632e49d47.mp3"}},{"text":"다르다니까.","meaning":"与众不同，非同一般","explanation":"다르다：与众不同，非同一般；다니까：再次强调已经说过的内容，非敬语：“都说了……”。","readings":[{"term":"다르다","audio":"/audio/1db38b4e543bc73e4860.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26824","senseId":"2","lemma":"다르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다르다니까","audio":"/audio/e39118445e85ed9f43cb.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这，这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"71687","definition":"用于指示与话者离得近的物品，或用于指示话者所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"4ba73c1f13e77796","term":"볼펜","zh":"圆珠笔","audio":"/audio/4ba73c1f13e77796fb2e.mp3","entryId":"59469","definition":"笔尖的小钢珠随着笔的移动一起滚动、同时带出墨水来写字的一种书写工具。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"f1f4ce417552e197","term":"다른","zh":"其他，别的","audio":"/audio/f1f4ce417552e1974311.mp3","entryId":"64530","definition":"除相关之外的。","pronunciation":["다른"]},{"id":"7d0f199c16a28826","term":"필기구","zh":"书写工具","audio":"/audio/7d0f199c16a288265746.mp3","entryId":"84316","definition":"纸、圆珠笔、铅笔等用于写字的各种物品。","pronunciation":["필기구"]},{"id":"56905f3c55459a5a","term":"손맛","zh":"手感","audio":"/audio/56905f3c55459a5a28ad.mp3","entryId":"64237","definition":"用手抚摸时的感觉。","pronunciation":["손맏"]},{"id":"1db38b4e543bc73e","term":"다르다","zh":"与众不同，非同一般","audio":"/audio/1db38b4e543bc73e4860.mp3","entryId":"26824","definition":"与普通的事物或人不一样，有特别的一面。","pronunciation":["다르다"]}],"audio":"/audio/f2b037799aaee74f4315.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.102,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=64237","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":147,"sequenceScore":2.9287,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["这支圆珠笔的书写手感和其他笔可不一样哦。","妈妈，今晚我们烤五花肉吃吧。","你总是只用那支圆珠笔啊。它有那么好吗？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["这支圆珠笔的书写手感和其他笔可不一样哦。","你总是只用那支圆珠笔啊。它有那么好吗？","妈妈，今晚我们烤五花肉吃吧。"],"answer":0}]}
